---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const MONERO_ADDRESS = '85EcePtnegBdhm6edVSvG3EjycyiedXfBJwUFyQjA3XbEvAxa2u5bXSVPPMBY8kj127yGbAsVHgGGgL3RsLyYqVR4pTbVfT';

// Clearsigned by Einliterflasche (key 10A9572D8099309434A126D490676A9B07184BC9),
// posted on https://github.com/eigenwallet/vision-ng/pull/4
const SIGNED_MESSAGE = `-----BEGIN PGP SIGNED MESSAGE-----
Hash: SHA512

I confirm we are setting up a Defense Fund under the Monero address 85EcePtnegBdhm6edVSvG3EjycyiedXfBJwUFyQjA3XbEvAxa2u5bXSVPPMBY8kj127yGbAsVHgGGgL3RsLyYqVR4pTbVfT.
-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----

iJEEARYKADkWIQQQqVctgJkwlDShJtSQZ2qbBxhLyQUCau/wHhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t
YW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQkGdqmwcYS8nL1gD7B1JaUkgXNYhaEYCRQTdF
P/juwCHWGrBGrlmHH2NlTe4A/AvDCIcFLvyMLLPoN9Y9qp/XmePd3w6m8kVnfa+N
AFUA
=tAtn
-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----`;
---

<Layout
  title="Defense Fund — eigenwallet"
  description="Support eigenwallet's security work. Donate Monero to help us strengthen our defenses."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#eee] mb-6">Defense Fund</h2>

    <p class="text-[#bbb] mb-4">
      Users entrust eigenwallet with their money, and we already do everything we can to prevent security issues upfront, in a number of ways. But LLMs and their new cybersecurity capabilities have widened the threats we face. That is why we are asking for your support in strengthening our defenses.
    </p>

    <p class="text-[#bbb] mb-4">
      If you are skeptical that this is useful, please read <a href="https://daniel.haxx.se/blog/2025/10/10/a-new-breed-of-analyzers/" target="_blank" class="text-[#f7a41d] hover:underline">this blog article by the curl maintainer</a>. AI systems are increasingly able to find and exploit obscure vulnerabilities that expert human reviewers had missed for years.
    </p>

    <p class="text-[#bbb] mb-4">
      To uphold our high standard of security, we run large-scale, preemptive investigations using a variety of tactics. These include custom-built harnesses, fuzzing systems and simulations. For this to work, we need a lot of tokens, and the more tokens, the better.
    </p>

    <p class="text-[#bbb] mb-4">
      We use a large variety of frontier models, both open and cyber-enabled closed ones, to find vulnerabilities before anyone else does.
    </p>

    <p class="text-[#bbb] mb-4">
      These systems are run by contributors who have been working on the project for four years. Any vulnerabilities they find are disclosed and fixed in a responsible manner, to minimize the risk our users are exposed to.
    </p>

    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#eee] mt-8 mb-4">Transparency</h4>

    <p class="text-[#bbb] mb-4">
      We will be transparent about how much the Defense Fund receives, how the funds are used, and how many vulnerabilities we find, if any. Details of each vulnerability will be published once it has been responsibly disclosed.
    </p>

    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#eee] mt-8 mb-4">Donate</h4>

    <p class="text-[#bbb] mb-4">
      Donations to the Defense Fund pay only for the tokens these systems use to discover vulnerabilities. They are not used for anything else.
    </p>

    <p class="text-[#bbb] mb-4 inline-flex items-center flex-wrap gap-1">
      Send Monero <img src="/imgs/icons/Monero.svg" alt="Monero" class="h-[1em] mx-0.5" /> here to fund tokens for preemptive vulnerability discovery:
    </p>

    <div class="border border-[#444] bg-[#1a1a1a] p-4 mb-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-3">
      <code id="defense-fund-address" class="flex-1 text-[#f7a41d] text-sm break-all font-mono">{MONERO_ADDRESS}</code>
      <button
        id="copy-address"
        type="button"
        class="shrink-0 bg-[#f7a41d] hover:bg-[#ffb732] text-black font-bold py-2 px-4 transition-colors"
      >
        Copy
      </button>
    </div>

    <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#eee] mt-8 mb-4">Signed proof</h4>

    <p class="text-[#bbb] mb-4">
      Below is a message signed by <a href="https://github.com/Einliterflasche" target="_blank" class="text-[#f7a41d] hover:underline"><em>Einliterflasche</em></a> with the PGP key <code class="text-[#f7a41d] bg-[#222] px-1 rounded break-all">10A9572D8099309434A126D490676A9B07184BC9</code>, confirming that this is the Defense Fund address.
    </p>

    <pre class="bg-[#222] p-4 rounded overflow-auto text-sm text-[#bbb] mb-6 whitespace-pre-wrap break-all"><code>{SIGNED_MESSAGE}</code></pre>
  </article>

  <script>
    const button = document.getElementById('copy-address');
    const address = document.getElementById('defense-fund-address');
    button?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      if (!address?.textContent) return;
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(address.textContent.trim());
        button.textContent = 'Copied';
      } catch {
        button.textContent = 'Copy failed';
      }
      setTimeout(() => (button.textContent = 'Copy'), 2000);
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
